(iv) wage paid and receipts given therefor; 
(v) leave, leave wages, overtime work, attendance and dangerous occurrences; and 
(vi) employment of adolescent; 
(b) display notices at the work place of the workers in such manner and form as may be 
prescribed by the appropriate Government; 
(c) issue wage slips to the workers, in electronic forms or otherwise; and 
(d) file such return electronically or otherwise to the Inspector -cum-Facilitator in such manner 
and during such periods as may be prescribed by the appropriate Government.

